  <ProfessionalSummary>覆盖主机冷却水系统应急冷却模式要求，包括自动切换、控制逻辑、低速运行及应急海水吸入功能。</ProfessionalSummary>
  <EngineeringRequirements count="4">
    <Requirement id="ER-P044-01" level="1" requirementType="redundancy">
      <sysml:Name>应急冷却模式自动切换</sysml:Name>
      <sysml:Text>主机冷却水系统应配置应急冷却模式，在海水泵故障时自动切换至应急海水吸入或备用泵，维持主机冷却水供应。</sysml:Text>
      <sysml:VerifiedBy method="commissioning_check" />
      <sysml:DerivedFrom refId="ER-P044" />
      <sysml:Traceability>
        <Evidence id="E-DNV-COOL-002" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-SOLAS-COOL-001" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-CCS-COOL-001" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-IACS-M3-001" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
      </sysml:Traceability>
      <sysml:QualityStatus>
        <SupportStatus>verified_by_direct_evidence</SupportStatus>
        <RiskIfUnmet>海水泵故障后无法自动切换将导致主机冷却中断，可能造成主机损坏。</RiskIfUnmet>
      </sysml:QualityStatus>
      <sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
        <Criterion>检查系统设计图纸，确认设有应急冷却模式切换回路。</Criterion>
        <Criterion>调试期间模拟海水泵故障，确认系统自动切换至应急海水吸入或备用泵，切换时间按项目调试大纲确认。</Criterion>
      </sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
      <sysml:EngineeringRationale>本条覆盖方面【应急冷却模式自动切换】，来自原始需求「在海水泵故障时自动切换至应急海水吸入或备用泵」。E-DNV-COOL-002 支撑了单泵故障时自动切换至备用泵的要求；E-SOLAS-COOL-001 支撑了主泵故障时冷却持续（备用泵自动启动或等效）的要求；E-CCS-COOL-001 支撑了冗余配置和自动切换要求；E-IACS-M3-001 支撑了至少两台泵的冗余配置。</sysml:EngineeringRationale>
