    <Requirement id="ER-P044-02" level="1" requirementType="control">
      <sysml:Name>应急模式自动控制逻辑</sysml:Name>
      <sysml:Text>应急冷却模式应具备自动控制逻辑，当检测到海水泵故障（如出口压力低）时，应自动启动备用泵或打开应急海水吸入阀，并触发报警。</sysml:Text>
      <sysml:VerifiedBy method="commissioning_check" />
      <sysml:DerivedFrom refId="ER-P044" />
      <sysml:Traceability>
        <Evidence id="E-SUPP-LDR-001" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-DNV-COOL-002" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-SOLAS-COOL-001" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
      </sysml:Traceability>
      <sysml:QualityStatus>
        <SupportStatus>verified_by_direct_evidence</SupportStatus>
        <RiskIfUnmet>自动控制逻辑缺失或失效将导致切换不及时，影响主机安全。</RiskIfUnmet>
      </sysml:QualityStatus>
      <sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
        <Criterion>审查控制逻辑图，确认包含低压检测、自动切换和报警功能。</Criterion>
        <Criterion>调试期间模拟海水泵出口低压，确认备用泵自动启动或应急海水吸入阀自动打开，并触发报警。</Criterion>
      </sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
      <sysml:EngineeringRationale>本条覆盖方面【应急模式自动控制逻辑】，来自原始需求「自动切换」。E-SUPP-LDR-001 支撑了低压报警触发自动切换备用泵的控制逻辑；E-DNV-COOL-002 支撑了自动切换并触发报警；E-SOLAS-COOL-001 支撑了温度异常时报警。</sysml:EngineeringRationale>
