        <SupportStatus>need_confirmation</SupportStatus>
        <RiskIfUnmet>应急模式下主机运行参数不明确可能导致主机过载或冷却不足。</RiskIfUnmet>
        <ApplicabilityConstraint>具体低速限值按主机厂家 Technical Data 确认。</ApplicabilityConstraint>
